̶A̶ ̶R̶E̶P̶Ú̶B̶L̶I̶C̶A̶ ̶F̶a̶ç̶o̶ ̶s̶a̶b̶e̶r̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶g̶r̶e̶s̶s̶o̶ ̶N̶a̶c̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶ ̶d̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶e̶u̶ ̶s̶a̶n̶c̶i̶o̶n̶o̶ ̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶:̶<br>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-9","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶a̶u̶t̶o̶r̶i̶z̶a̶ ̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶ ̶e̶n̶q̶u̶a̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶d̶u̶r̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶r̶i̶s̶e̶ ̶o̶c̶a̶s̶i̶o̶n̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶r̶o̶n̶a̶v̶í̶r̶u̶s̶ ̶(̶S̶A̶R̶S̶-̶C̶o̶V̶-̶2̶)̶.̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶a̶u̶t̶o̶r̶i̶z̶a̶ ̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶ ̶e̶n̶q̶u̶a̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶d̶u̶r̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶r̶i̶s̶e̶ ̶o̶c̶a̶s̶i̶o̶n̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶r̶o̶n̶a̶v̶í̶r̶u̶s̶ ̶(̶S̶A̶R̶S̶-̶C̶o̶V̶-̶2̶)̶.̶<br>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-10","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶D̶u̶r̶a̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶r̶i̶s̶e̶ ̶o̶c̶a̶s̶i̶o̶n̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶r̶o̶n̶a̶v̶í̶r̶u̶s̶ ̶(̶S̶A̶R̶S̶-̶C̶o̶V̶-̶2̶)̶,̶ ̶f̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶a̶u̶t̶o̶r̶i̶z̶a̶d̶o̶,̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶e̶m̶e̶r̶g̶e̶n̶c̶i̶a̶l̶,̶ ̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶.̶ ̶P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶.̶ ̶(̶V̶E̶T̶A̶D̶O̶)̶.̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶D̶u̶r̶a̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶r̶i̶s̶e̶ ̶o̶c̶a̶s̶i̶o̶n̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶r̶o̶n̶a̶v̶í̶r̶u̶s̶ ̶(̶S̶A̶R̶S̶-̶C̶o̶V̶-̶2̶)̶,̶ ̶f̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶a̶u̶t̶o̶r̶i̶z̶a̶d̶o̶,̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶e̶m̶e̶r̶g̶e̶n̶c̶i̶a̶l̶,̶ ̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶.̶<br>\n̶P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶.̶ ̶(̶V̶E̶T̶A̶D̶O̶)̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-11","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶E̶n̶t̶e̶n̶d̶e̶-̶s̶e̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶,̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶u̶t̶r̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶o̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶ ̶m̶e̶d̶i̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶c̶n̶o̶l̶o̶g̶i̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶i̶s̶t̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶p̶e̶s̶q̶u̶i̶s̶a̶,̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶v̶e̶n̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶o̶e̶n̶ç̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶l̶e̶s̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶p̶r̶o̶m̶o̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶a̶ú̶d̶e̶.̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶E̶n̶t̶e̶n̶d̶e̶-̶s̶e̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶,̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶u̶t̶r̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶o̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶ ̶m̶e̶d̶i̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶c̶n̶o̶l̶o̶g̶i̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶i̶s̶t̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶p̶e̶s̶q̶u̶i̶s̶a̶,̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶v̶e̶n̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶o̶e̶n̶ç̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶l̶e̶s̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶p̶r̶o̶m̶o̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶a̶ú̶d̶e̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-12","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶4̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶m̶é̶d̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶v̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶i̶n̶f̶o̶r̶m̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶p̶a̶c̶i̶e̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶t̶o̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶s̶ ̶l̶i̶m̶i̶t̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶i̶n̶e̶r̶e̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶,̶ ̶t̶e̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶v̶i̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶i̶m̶p̶o̶s̶s̶i̶b̶i̶l̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶x̶a̶m̶e̶ ̶f̶í̶s̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶u̶r̶a̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶u̶l̶t̶a̶.̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶4̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶m̶é̶d̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶v̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶i̶n̶f̶o̶r̶m̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶p̶a̶c̶i̶e̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶t̶o̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶s̶ ̶l̶i̶m̶i̶t̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶i̶n̶e̶r̶e̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶,̶ ̶t̶e̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶v̶i̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶i̶m̶p̶o̶s̶s̶i̶b̶i̶l̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶x̶a̶m̶e̶ ̶f̶í̶s̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶u̶r̶a̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶u̶l̶t̶a̶.̶<br>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-13","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶5̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶A̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶v̶i̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶r̶á̶ ̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶a̶d̶r̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶n̶o̶r̶m̶a̶t̶i̶v̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶é̶t̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶u̶s̶u̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶t̶e̶n̶d̶i̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶c̶i̶a̶l̶,̶ ̶i̶n̶c̶l̶u̶s̶i̶v̶e̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶r̶e̶l̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶à̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶t̶r̶a̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶a̶n̶c̶e̶i̶r̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶v̶i̶ç̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶,̶ ̶n̶ã̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶b̶e̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶c̶u̶s̶t̶e̶a̶r̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶p̶a̶g̶a̶r̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶a̶t̶i̶v̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶a̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶n̶ã̶o̶ ̶f̶o̶r̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶l̶u̶s̶i̶v̶a̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶v̶i̶ç̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶S̶i̶s̶t̶e̶m̶a̶ ̶Ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶a̶ú̶d̶e̶ ̶(̶S̶U̶S̶)̶.̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶5̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶A̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶v̶i̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶t̶e̶l̶e̶m̶e̶d̶i̶c̶i̶n̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶r̶á̶ ̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶a̶d̶r̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶n̶o̶r̶m̶a̶t̶i̶v̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶é̶t̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶u̶s̶u̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶t̶e̶n̶d̶i̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶c̶i̶a̶l̶,̶ ̶i̶n̶c̶l̶u̶s̶i̶v̶e̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶r̶e̶l̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶à̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶t̶r̶a̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶a̶n̶c̶e̶i̶r̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶v̶i̶ç̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶,̶ ̶n̶ã̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶b̶e̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶c̶u̶s̶t̶e̶a̶r̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶p̶a̶g̶a̶r̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶a̶t̶i̶v̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶a̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶n̶ã̶o̶ ̶f̶o̶r̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶l̶u̶s̶i̶v̶a̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶v̶i̶ç̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶S̶i̶s̶t̶e̶m̶a̶ ̶Ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶a̶ú̶d̶e̶ ̶(̶S̶U̶S̶)̶.̶<br>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-14","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶6̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶(̶V̶E̶T̶A̶D̶O̶)̶.̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶6̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶(̶V̶E̶T̶A̶D̶O̶)̶.̶<br>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-15","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶7̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶a̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶v̶i̶g̶o̶r̶ ̶n̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶t̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶u̶a̶ ̶p̶u̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶.̶ ̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶7̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶a̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶v̶i̶g̶o̶r̶ ̶n̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶t̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶u̶a̶ ̶p̶u̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶.̶ ̶<br>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-16","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"B̶r̶a̶s̶í̶l̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶ ̶1̶5̶ ̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶b̶r̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶;̶ ̶1̶9̶9̶.̶º̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶I̶n̶d̶e̶p̶e̶n̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶1̶3̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶.̶ ̶O PRESIDENTE DA REPÚBLICA Faço saber que o Congresso Nacional decreta e eu sanciono a seguinte Lei:","html":"B̶r̶a̶s̶í̶l̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶ ̶1̶5̶ ̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶b̶r̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶;̶ ̶1̶9̶9̶.̶º̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶I̶n̶d̶e̶p̶e̶n̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶1̶3̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶.̶ ̶O PRESIDENTE DA REPÚBLICA Faço saber que o Congresso Nacional 